                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndelo aucel obedo ma timo tic, to ndelo mar'abirio obedo sabato ma ywomirok adieri, cokirok maleŋ; wikiri witim tic moro je. Obedo sabato pa Rwoth kamoro je ma winobed'iye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.3"
            ]
          }
        }
