            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.23.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wok 23:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.34.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "34:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.16.9+DEU.16.10+DEU.16.11+DEU.16.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cik 16:9-12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka wok i ndelo ma luwo sabato, wok i ndelo ma wikel'iye withi olemo ma mic atiŋa malo, wikwan sabato abirio m'ocowere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikwan cuka tundo i ndelo ma luwo sabato mar'abirio, ndelo piero abic; nyaka to wikelo mic ma cemo manyinge manyen ri Rwoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikel wok kama wibed'iye muma mugat ario paka mic atiŋa malo, kisi muma acel wobedi ario ma wi apar ma kilo; jowobedi ma moko m'oyer, m'obak gi thow, paka olemo marapena ri Rwoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikel gi mugat no wot rombo abirio ma jo oro acel ma jongoye gi ŋolo, rwath acel, gi wot rombo ario; jolabedo mic awaŋa ri Rwoth, kanyacel gi mic pajo ma cemo kodi mic pajo amadha, mic awaŋa ma ŋwece kur mamit ri Rwoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wimiy bende wod diel acel ri mic ma cwako reco, gi wot rombo ario ma jo oro acel paka cowirok ma mic ma siem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jacway ri Were i wi migam latiŋo jo malo gi mugat mar'olemo marapena paka mic atiŋa malo ruwaŋ Rwoth, kanyacel gi nyithindhi rombo ma wote ario; jolabedo maleŋ ri Rwoth ri jacway ri Were i wi migam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.20",
