        },
        {
          "text": "Ka wikeco ranyak ma ndelo mewin, wikiri wikec kiri i thengi ndelin mewin, kosa wicoki withi ranyak ma oy; wiripo weyo jo ri jocandi kodi jokicar: An abedo Rwoth Were mewin.",
