          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth oluwo gi Musa ka waco ama: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Luw gi Joisiraili, k'iwaco ama: I dwe mar'abirio, i ndelo marapena ma dwe, wobedi ndelo ma sabato, ma wopoy cokirok maleŋ gi kudho gwarin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikiri witim tic moro je ma kisi ndelo; to wikel mic awaŋa ri Rwoth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ndelo ma cwako reco",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
